pan style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">교육 보증금 입금<br></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">선정된 교육생은 교육 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">보증금 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">5</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">만원을 </span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">7</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">19</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">금</span></u></span><spa